WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.011
Jack stared at the beanstalk.

2
00:00:07.012 --> 00:00:10.714
It went up, up, up into the sky.

3
00:00:10.715 --> 00:00:14.173
Clouds hid the top of it.

4
00:00:14.174 --> 00:00:18.248
"That man was telling the truth," Jack thought.

5
00:00:18.249 --> 00:00:24.817
"Those beans were magic!"

6
00:00:24.818 --> 00:00:34.734
Carefully Jack climbed onto the beanstalk.

7
00:00:34.735 --> 00:00:38.530
He climbed and climbed.

8
00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:43.579
Soon his house was far below.

9
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:52.588
"Whoa!" Jack said. "This beanstalk is tall!"

10
00:00:52.589 --> 00:01:01.579
Jack climbed higher and higher.

11
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:12.333
He passed through clouds.

12
00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:23.747
And then he saw a strange land.

13
00:01:23.748 --> 00:01:27.840
Jack stepped off the beanstalk.

14
00:01:27.841 --> 00:01:45.659
"Where am I?" he thought.

15
00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:53.202
Jack walked along a road.

16
00:01:53.203 --> 00:01:59.139
He grew tired and hungry.

17
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.872
Jack spotted a tall house.

18
00:02:04.873 --> 00:02:08.721
A woman stood in the doorway.

19
00:02:08.722 --> 00:02:17.786
"Maybe she'll give me food," Jack thought.

20
00:02:17.787 --> 00:02:22.134
"Good morning!" Jack called politely.

21
00:02:22.135 --> 00:02:25.874
He rubbed his belly. "I'm very hungry.

22
00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:29.348
Can you please give me some breakfast?"

23
00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:33.212
"Um . . . " The woman looked nervous.

24
00:02:33.213 --> 00:02:36.624
She glanced all around and then back at Jack.

25
00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:40.027
"You want something to eat?"

26
00:02:40.028 --> 00:02:44.691
Jack stepped closer. "Yes, please.

27
00:02:44.692 --> 00:02:47.056
I missed supper last night.

28
00:02:47.057 --> 00:02:50.855
And I had no breakfast this morning."

29
00:02:50.856 --> 00:02:56.046
The woman bit her lip. "You should leave now."

30
00:02:56.047 --> 00:03:00.857
"Why?" Jack asked.

31
00:03:00.858 --> 00:03:04.359
"My husband," the woman whispered.

32
00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:10.379
"He's an ogre!"

